# Auto-generated OpenAPI specs and models
# These are regenerated during container startup:
#  - contracts/strapi.openapi.yaml: Generated by CMS service from content types
#  - contracts/affilibuster.openapi.yaml: Merged by Backend from template + strapi specs
#  - backend/src/affilibuster_backend/domain/entities/generated/: Python models generated by Backend
# Note: To allow cloud llm we will commit these auto-generated files.
#backend/src/affilibuster_backend/domain/entities/generated/
#contracts/strapi.openapi.yaml
#contracts/affilibuster.openapi.yaml
#cms/types/
#the-green-brother/src/lib/generated/

openapi-ts-error-*.log

.fake
